s resilient pipelines and friction-free workflows for creative teams. This is exactly what I bring to Sunblink: removing friction for your artists by building dependable, production-ready procedural systems.\n\nI’m currently looking for freelance Technical Artist missions via my own structure, and I can take on a defined scope (tools, pipeline integration, or environment production) on a short or long engagement.\n\nI would be happy to walk you through my tools and talk with you by video call, whenever suits you.\n\nMatthieu Huguet\nTechnical Artist · Houdini & Unreal Engine 5\nmatthieuhuguet.com · linkedin.com/in/zenray",
